Z||000003||1FST2M6||11-29-2000||09:16 AM||||i have a installed a few sets of custom made solid mounts. one in my car(87GT) one in RodrV6(84 4spd) and one Poly set on BlackGTs(87GT). after driving theses for a while and driving a car with Poly mounts.. there is really NO noticable difference between the two. i have Bilstiens and custom wound springs. the car with polys has monroe sensa-tracs and Jamex springs (BlackGTs). there is; like on my car.. little to NO chassis flex. and it's WAY cheaper... call Chris or Danny at Nopi and get a set of Prothane Cradle mounts for less than the Fiero store sells them for.. part # 7-502. Their # is 770-434-0200||||reg||1
